{%- comment -%}
  Outputs the account-page URL for a signed-in customer.

  When a logged-in landing page is configured (settings.customer_logged_in_url),
  links straight to it — the customer is already authenticated, so no return_to
  router hop is needed (unlike snippets/customer-login-url.liquid). Falls back to
  the default account route when no landing page is set.

  Renders no value other than the URL (safe to use inside href="" and as a filter
  argument).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if settings.customer_logged_in_url != blank
    echo settings.customer_logged_in_url
  else
    echo routes.account_url
  endif
-%}
